            "review_text": "MeMyToo\n1 contribution\n0\nFriendly, tasty, quick service & cheap.\nAug 2018 • Couples\nWe have eaten twice at 'My Deli' on this visit to Hanoi. Duc has now moved his restaurant into an air-conditioned indoor venue ( he was kerbside). We tried the pizza the last time - seafood. It was tasty & very good value for two. But my favourite remains the 'homemade squid ink linguine pasta with seafood creamy sauce'. Yummy. A generous serve, promptly delivered. Very good customer service from friendly staff. We highly recommend 'My Deli'.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 30, 2018",
