            "review_text": "karen2558\nMelbourne, Australia271 contributions\n0\nSimple but tasty food\nJul 2018 • Family\nMy daughter and I ate here as it was close to our hotel and, after walking for hours around the frenetic streets of Hanoi, we simply wanted a quick meal before retiring. This cafe is very small but we found it to be an air conditioned oasis! The menu was fairly small and featured some nice looking pasta dishes. I ordered a ham and cheese toasted sandwich and was surprised to receive a sandwich which also included egg. Nevertheless, I really enjoyed it as despite it being a simple meal, it was very tasty. My daughter enjoyed her pasta dish. Although this cafe didn't offer Asian food, we really enjoyed our meal as it was fresh, tasty and promptly served.\nRead more\nWritten July 20, 2018",
